    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan opens the wings in the Tie clan chase, Tie Xian Hua calls them a rank four flying type Gu and notes that the intel had not listed any flying type Gu for little beast king. Flying type Gu are a type of movement Gu worms, expensive and rare, so few Gu Masters possess them. Observers conclude he must have obtained the bone wings very recently.",
