  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "After the King Xin Inheritance stretch, Fang Yuan refines Bone wings Gu from a footless bird Gu also taken as a reward there. Most of the refinement materials are leftovers from King Xin Inheritance, and a portion is bought from Li Xian. He uses a total of a hundred and eighty thousand primeval stones before the refinement finishes.",
        "chapters": [
          358
